{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e3323976-719e-880f-aacd-ce3ec6955281",
  "created_at": "2026-03-07T10:11:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is George Thurston. I call this line because City Hall is closed today, Saturday. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly what this line's for. Go ahead, George."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I am at 694 Thames Street. Down at the low corner, near the drain. This rain, Friday to this morning, the street fill up again. Up to the curb. I have to walk in the water to get to my car. Water over my shoes. [inaudible] my ankles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. Over your ankles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Over the ankles. I am sorry, I am walking in the hallway of the building where I work, it makes the echo. The signal is not good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I can hear the footsteps, you're okay. Did any water get in the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. The house is fine. Inside is dry. My fathers' house, no problem inside. But the two houses next to us, the neighbors, they have water in the cellar. Both of them. The next one and the one after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me pull up the address. [pause] Yeah, I've got 694 Thames. I see a call from you January tenth, and another one on the twelfth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is me. This is the third time I call. In January, the crew come two times. Two times they take the leaves off the grate and they go. Nobody look under. Now it happen again, the same. Same corner, same water. I don't understand why nobody fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. What I've got here is grate cleared on the twelfth, grate cleared on the thirteenth. Nothing about the line underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The top is clean, the water still stay. So the problem is down. Not the leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask you one thing? This drain. Who is responsible? The city, or the state? Because maybe I call the wrong people every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Thames is mostly ours, and the basin at that corner shows up in our system, but I'm not the one who can tell you for sure who owns the pipe underneath. I'll put that question right in the ticket so a supervisor answers it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, [line breaks up] who answer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A supervisor. I'm writing down that you want to know if it's city or state, and that the grate's been cleared twice and it still backs up. So they look further this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Supervisor. Good. Because I don't want the crew to come, clean the top, and go again. Three times the same thing. My neighbors, they lose things in the cellar now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So I'm logging a catch basin backup at 694 Thames, street up to curb height, third report. Crew's scheduled to come out Monday, the ninth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. March nine. Let me say back to be sure. The crew come Monday, and a supervisor call me about the city or the state?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crew Monday, yes. The supervisor callback I'm requesting, so it might not be Monday itself, but it's in there. What's a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151. It is my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please, tell them check under the street. Not only the grate. Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put it in plain words: grate's been done twice, look below. I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I am sorry to be strong about it. Is just, every rain, the same. I am tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You don't need to apologize. Three calls on one corner, I'd be fed up too. Anything else this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Monday, I will look for the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay George. Dry your feet off, alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-07T10:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
